{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e243846122a24031","name":"Devastator War Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-e243846122a24031","title":"Devastator War Droid","revision":19105,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:19:34Z","sha256":"5fd9edf8642cf4019d9739d99754d099b1201ff37fc840d1087308bff2ad2f05","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19105","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Devastator%20War%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e243846122a24031","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ubrikkian Steamworks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ubrikkian_Steamworks?action=edit&redlink=1"}," as an upgrade to the popular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sentinel Droid Mark I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sentinel_Droid_Mark_I","referenceId":"reference:5f8d64b952d59856"}," designed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kellenech Technologies"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kellenech_Technologies?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the Devastator War Droid has been called as Assassin Droid by those who have faced it. The Devastator War Droid is a dangerous and tough Droid that is difficult to bring down. Redundant systems help reduce the effect of damage on the Droid's combat readiness. A Devastator War Droid is capable of continuing to fight at over 85% combat efficiency even after losing a limb or other significant system, making it the perfect Droid to operate on the front lines of battle.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ubrikkian Steamworks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ubrikkian_Steamworks?action=edit&redlink=1"}," expects to sell the Droid to the private security market, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," designates the Devastator War Droid too sophisticated and dangerous to be in private hands, declaring that only individuals and organizations with special permission from the Military Arms Regulatory Bureau can purchase these Droids. As a result, the massive profits that Ubrikkian expected to make (based on the estimates that one third of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sentinel Droid Mark I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sentinel_Droid_Mark_I","referenceId":"reference:5f8d64b952d59856"}," owners would upgrade to the Devastator War Droids) never come, and Ubrikkian is forced to cut production of the Droids almost as soon as it begins. As a result, only a few of these Droids can be found anywhere in the galaxy, most in the hands of mercenaries and crime syndicates.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Devastator War Droids can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Devastator War Droid Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 9/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +13; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +11\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":